rale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubisoft propose une visite en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle de Notre-Dame de Paris \u00e0 partir de la reconstitution du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle extraite du jeu Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Mobile_Icon_EN.png", "id": "5505549282843861", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031325_5505549292843860_5100780693875841273_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=huAq2yHZQ_IQ7kNvwEwQBdn&_nc_oc=Ado2tzcNfkAuTeTKFISXe8AzxbXYaeRG-8fIxxBeZesg4Jz-snzLGptwD3ioNNjlXEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWcU_ozfJlge7fpE3EbLsosghwbKnGAGs5sVur0H2ZjSw&oe=6B0EFAF8"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_EN.png", "id": "2626086864190393", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031371_2626086867523726_7267842356612940618_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PaAxIRYHP9sQ7kNvwFC6j6D&_nc_oc=AdoGjPfJi92jiuT1AVbR7OBXrlcGz5Hes0uUwWgqFQcnR2n_jWNpoy4dRNR0ZSRH1Ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW-gWe3jeB9uYCEOIpCpCHkSK2qSsg6J9z4XjrPqgVZvQ&oe=6B0EEB58"}, {"file_name": "VR_Landscape_EN.png", "id": "1543686999397216", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031515_1543687002730549_2548295266512135503_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JFl9tN7qEgUQ7kNvwHKjGkn&_nc_oc=Adpq5XsaT4qEijnn7YwvzjaB4nnBSWKKTaU